Wrote the label file with one row for `misinformation`. Since the only source (AB 2839's chaptered bill text) explicitly exempts platforms from liability ("does not impose liability on an interactive computer service"), it targets content distributors, not platforms, so I coded V2 as `adjacent`/V4 `off-axis` and left the row `BLANK: no-evidence` — none of the five platform-obligation rungs are established.
